  "prefLabel": "Ph 2004.02 Notice of Disciplinary Action",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ph 2004.02 Notice of Disciplinary Action. An outsourcing facility licensed under these rules shall, within 30 days of any written warnings or disciplinary action from any state or federal licensing or enforcement agency, notify the board and provide a copy of the action to the board office, identified in Ph 103.03.\n\nSource. #12336, eff 7-22-17",
